        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CIREDN, Eden Prairie Knob with Circulaire Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Eden Prairie Knob with Circulaire Rose has a classic look that is timeless and beautiful. It will look stunning in nearly every traditional home. This Circulaire Rosette with Eden Prairie Knob is available in a wide array of finish colors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Eden Prairie Knob with Circulaire Rosette will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CIREDN Circulaire Rosette with Eden Prairie Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Eden Prairie Egg Knob with Circulaire Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CIREDN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262389\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CIREDN Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working, knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
